        <li id="ref-2"><a href="#ref-2" class="backlink">↑</a> ETIC Club, ESI Algiers — student association and event records. <a href="https://esi.dz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">esi.dz</a>.</li>
        <li id="ref-3"><a href="#ref-3" class="backlink">↑</a> <a href="/contact">Contact — Aness Bouziani</a>. Self-published, <span class="mono">{now.getFullYear()}</span>.</li>
        <li id="ref-4"><a href="#ref-4" class="backlink">↑</a> <a href="/">Aness Bouziani — portfolio v3</a>. <span class="mono">{now.getFullYear()}</span>.</li>
      </ol>

